"The South African Society of Anaesthesiologists regional anaesthesia guideline of 2016 bases its anticoagulation section on the ASRA guideline": ["La recommandation d'anesthésie régionale de la South African Society of Anaesthesiologists (2016) fonde sa section sur l'anticoagulation sur celle de l'ASRA","La guía de anestesia regional de la South African Society of Anaesthesiologists de 2016 basa su apartado de anticoagulación en la guía de ASRA","Die Regionalanästhesie-Leitlinie der South African Society of Anaesthesiologists von 2016 stützt ihren Abschnitt zur Antikoagulation auf die ASRA-Leitlinie","La linea guida di anestesia regionale della South African Society of Anaesthesiologists del 2016 basa la sezione sull'anticoagulazione sulla linea guida ASRA","South African Society of Anaesthesiologists'in 2016 bölgesel anestezi kılavuzu, antikoagülasyon bölümünü ASRA kılavuzuna dayandırır","South African Society of Anaesthesiologists riktlinje för regionalanestesi från 2016 bygger sitt avsnitt om antikoagulation på ASRA:s riktlinje","South African Society of Anaesthesiologists-இன் 2016 பகுதி மயக்க வழிகாட்டுதல், இரத்த உறைவுத் தடுப்புப் பகுதியை ASRA வழிகாட்டுதலின் அடிப்படையில் அமைத்துள்ளது","A diretriz de anestesia regional de 2016 da South African Society of Anaesthesiologists baseia sua seção sobre anticoagulação na diretriz da ASRA","يستند قسم مضادات التخثر في الدليل الإرشادي للتخدير الناحي الصادر عن South African Society of Anaesthesiologists عام 2016 إلى دليل ASRA"],
